==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Tinkatuff|103}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Light Punch''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|VS|Bruno's Ursaring|85}} from the {{TCG|Pokémon VS}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Tinkatuff}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

